5. JARVIS ROLE — GOVERNANCE GATE

JARVIS enforces:

Rule A — Generalization Check

If technique applies only once → reject


---

Rule B — Compression Requirement

If technique cannot be compressed → reject


---

Rule C — Noise Exclusion

If output depends on ChatGPT error/hallucination → reject


---

Rule D — System Fit Check

If technique overlaps existing memory → merge


